@startuml activity-message-lookup
!include include/style.iuml
title Message lookup and formatting

start
:gettext(message, **params) is called;
if (inside use_locale() block?) then (yes)
  :use that block's translator;
elseif (inside a request?) then (yes)
  :use the request's translator;
elseif (a process default Localization exists?) then (yes)
  :use its default-locale translator;
else (no)
  :raise LocalizationNotConfiguredError;
  stop
endif
:look up the message in the domain's fallback chain;
note right
  Chain for pt-BR:
  pt-BR catalog, pt catalog,
  default locale catalog, msgid.
  A locale in the source language
  skips the default locale catalog.
end note
:take the first translation found\n(or the msgid if none);
:replace each {name} with its value\nand {{ }} with literal braces;
if (a placeholder has no value?) then (yes)
  :leave it as written;
  :log a warning once per message and locale;
endif
:return the text;
stop
@enduml
